      <a href="#quick-comparison">Comparison Table</a>
      <a href="#how-we-picked">How We Picked</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Top Picks</a>
      <a href="#sugar-free-vs-no-added-sugar">Sugar Free vs No Added Sugar</a>
      <a href="#sugar-alcohols-allulose">Sugar Alcohols and Allulose</a>
      <a href="#whey-plant-lactose">Where the Sugar Comes From</a>
      <a href="#diabetes-keto">Diabetes, Keto and Weight Loss</a>
      <a href="#choosing">How to Choose</a>
