            We paid particular attention to what replaces the sugar. A powder can reach 0 g of sugar with sucralose, stevia, monk fruit, sugar alcohols or nothing at all, and those choices matter for taste, digestion and, for some readers, personal preference. The list deliberately includes each approach so you can choose the trade-off you prefer.
